  m_text: "You get points by tapping on the fish on your side of the screen. \r\n\r\nSpecial
    abilities:\nThere are fish that buff you or debuff your opponent and after a
    while you will be able to use a powerful ultimate ability.\r\n\r\nToy Boat:\nBe
    careful of the toy boat that's moving around the pond! It will destroy your fish
    once it hits them. Quickly tap it to have it move to your opponents side. "
